# Accessibility Quick Reference

## WCAG 2.1 AA Requirements
- Normal text: 4.5:1 contrast ratio
- Large text (18pt+/14pt+ bold): 3:1 contrast ratio
- UI components/focus: 3:1 contrast ratio

## Focus Indicators
```scss
.interactive {
	&:focus-visible {
		outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus);
		outline-offset: 2px;
	}
}

// ❌ Never remove without replacement
*:focus { outline: none; }
```

## Reduced Motion
```scss
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
	*, *::before, *::after {
		animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
		transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
	}
}
```

## Skip Link
```php
<a class="skip-link screen-reader-text" href="#main-content">
	<?php esc_html_e( 'Skip to content', 'skel' ); ?>
</a>
```

## Form Accessibility
```php
<label for="field-id">Label <span class="required" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
<input
	type="text"
	id="field-id"
	name="field"
	required
	aria-required="true"
	aria-describedby="field-error"
	autocomplete="name"
>
<p id="field-error" class="field-error" hidden aria-live="polite"></p>
```

## Images
```php
// Informative
<img src="..." alt="<?php echo esc_attr( $description ); ?>">

// Decorative
<img src="..." alt="" aria-hidden="true">
```

## Interactive Components
```php
// Button toggle
<button
	aria-expanded="false"
	aria-controls="panel-id"
>
	Toggle
</button>
<div id="panel-id" hidden>Content</div>

// Modal
<div
	role="dialog"
	aria-modal="true"
	aria-labelledby="modal-title"
	hidden
>
	<h2 id="modal-title">Title</h2>
</div>
```

## Navigation
```php
<nav aria-label="<?php esc_attr_e( 'Primary Navigation', 'skel' ); ?>">
	<button aria-controls="menu" aria-expanded="false">
		<span class="screen-reader-text">Menu</span>
	</button>
	<?php wp_nav_menu( [ 'menu_id' => 'menu' ] ); ?>
</nav>
```

## Keyboard Navigation
```javascript
const handleKeydown = (event) => {
	switch (event.key) {
		case 'Escape':
			closeModal();
			break;
		case 'Tab':
			// Handle focus trap
			break;
	}
};
```

## Testing Checklist
- [ ] Tab order logical
- [ ] Focus visible on all interactive elements
- [ ] Color contrast meets WCAG AA
- [ ] Images have appropriate alt text
- [ ] Forms have proper labels
- [ ] ARIA attributes correct
- [ ] Keyboard navigation works
